{"id": "g8-032", "domain": "farm", "names": ["Hen", "Cow", "Barn"], "groups": {"Stock": ["Hen", "Cow"]}, "text": "Is Barn in any group? And send Stock to the back, make Stock gray, turn Barn into a rectangle.", "wires": [{"span": "Is Barn in any group", "trigger": "in any group", "type": "question", "args": {"ask": "groupOf", "target": "Barn"}}, {"span": "send Stock to the back", "trigger": "send", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "toBack", "target": "Stock"}}, {"span": "make Stock gray", "trigger": "make", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Stock", "color": "gray"}}, {"span": "turn Barn into a rectangle", "trigger": "turn", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Barn", "shape": "rectangle"}}]}
{"id": "g8-033", "domain": "rocket", "names": ["Nose", "Body", "Fin1", "Fin2"], "groups": {}, "text": "Rocket sketch. Fins together: group Fin1 and Fin2 as Fins. Turn Nose into a triangle and Body into a large white rectangle. Fins should be left of Body... hmm no, Fins below Body. Show me Fins.", "wires": [{"span": "group Fin1 and Fin2 as Fins", "trigger": "group", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "group", "target": "Fin1,Fin2", "name": "Fins"}}, {"span": "Turn Nose into a triangle", "trigger": "Turn", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Nose", "shape": "triangle"}}, {"span": "Body into a large white rectangle", "trigger": "into", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Body", "shape": "rectangle", "color": "white", "size": "large"}}, {"span": "Fins below Body", "trigger": "below", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "move", "target": "Fins", "position": "below", "anchor": "Body"}}, {"span": "Show me Fins", "trigger": "Show me", "type": "question", "args": {"ask": "members", "target": "Fins"}}]}
{"id": "g8-034", "domain": "e-learning", "names": ["Quiz", "Video", "Notes"], "groups": {"Course": ["Quiz", "Video"]}, "text": "Add Notes to Course. Then ungroup Course, I changed my mind. Reshape Quiz as a diamond. how many groups are there?", "wires": [{"span": "Add Notes to Course", "trigger": "Add", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "group", "target": "Notes,Course", "name": "Course"}}, {"span": "ungroup Course", "trigger": "ungroup", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "ungroup", "target": "Course"}}, {"span": "Reshape Quiz as a diamond", "trigger": "Reshape", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Quiz", "shape": "diamond"}}, {"span": "how many groups are there", "trigger": "how many groups", "type": "question", "args": {"ask": "count", "kind": "group"}}]}
